 "name": "Hail Hydra (Zaxara + Gargos merged)",
 "notes": [
  "Nov 23 2026: folded Gargos: Hydra Tribal into this deck. Zaxara leads, Gargos sits in the 99. Main list about $281 (Nov 12 prices); the budget version is about $134.",
  "Infinite mana: Freed from the Real or Pemmin's Aura on Zaxara (net {U} or any color per loop), Kami of Whispered Hopes (power 2+), Incubation Druid with a counter, or Bloom Tender with blue and green permanents out.",
  "Kill with infinite mana: Walking Ballista, Exsanguinate, Torment of Hailfire, or Blue Sun's Zenith targeting each opponent for their library (it shuffles back in, so recast). Each X spell also makes a huge Zaxara Hydra token.",
  "Find the combo: Drift of Phantasms (transmute finds Freed or Pemmin's), Diabolic Tutor, Diabolic Revelation; Green Sun's Zenith and Finale of Devastation find Kami, Druid or Bloom Tender.",
  "Gargos makes Hydra spells cost {4} less, which also lowers X costs. Hungering Hydra at X=4 costs {G}.",
  "Two-card infinite with the commander: flag it to new tables. No fetch or shock lands.",
  "Shared copies: Exsanguinate and Toxic Deluge are also in Doom Unrivaled; Three Visits is earmarked for Hulk; both Birds of Paradise are spoken for."
 ],
